UIE Prior Utility

This research implementation includes the unmodified model.py from:
WWE-UIE: A Wavelet & White Balance Efficient Network for Underwater Image Enhancement
Ching-Heng Cheng, Jen-Wei Lee, Chia-Ming Lee, Chih-Chung Hsu.
Official source: https://github.com/chingheng0808/WWE-UIE
License: Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE).
Pinned revision and source SHA-256 are recorded in UPSTREAM.json.
The vendored file is uie/vendor/wwe.py.

All surrounding training, data, runtime, flow/diffusion, utility, evaluation and test
code is newly implemented for this project. The new training recipe and metrics
are not the official WWE-UIE reproduction. Model weights and benchmark images are
not included. Each dataset remains subject to its original provider's terms.
